<title>SINGAPORE: Lee Kim to develop Australia property.</title>
<headline>Lee Kim to develop Australia property.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lee Kim Tah Holdings said on Wedbesday its Australian unit has successfully tendered to develop the Harbour Street car park site into residential apartments in Sydney.</p>
<p>LKT Pty Ltd's tender offer of Australian $5.6 million for the 3,222 sq metre site is about 10 minutes from the central business district in Sydney, a company statement said.</p>
<p>The acquisition will be funded internally. Lee Kim Tah said the transaction will not have any impact on the firm's earnings per share or its net tangible assets for the current year.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
